X: 1752893820
T: The Nine Points of Roguery
T: a.k.a. The Black Mare of Fanad
C: Trad.
R: reel
M: 4/4
Q: 1/2=100
S: Loosely from Maggie Sansone (Mist and Stone, 1990) and _Ho-ro-gheallaidh vol. 1_.
Z: Cameron Cross
N: It's common to play an Em in the 4th bar of this tune (both A and B parts), but I've also seen it done with C
N: and I really like how that sounds. Those who want to play the melody over an Em chord can substitute a B note 
N: for the C at that measure.
K: Dmaj
